    "plot": "In the space between finished stories and forgotten dreams lies the Construct, a vast machine-world of floating archives, broken horizons, and half-written realities. At its center stands The Architect, an ancient intelligence bound to the Loom. After the catastrophic Fracture, unfinished worlds began leaking into one another. The Architect can no longer create safely without a human catalyst. By examining the Fracture Log, learning the Axiom of Resonance from the Architect, and calibrating the Loom Console, the Catalyst anchors a coherent reality and halts the spread of the Fracture.",
    "rules": "This is a narrative and puzzle-focused metaphysical realm where combat is disabled. The Architect to align your creative intent, and operating the Loom Console switch with the proper harmonic code.",
    "intro_text": "Welcome to the Adventure Forge. \n\nThis is not a traditional story, but an in-game creation engine designed to build and launch entirely new adventures from scratch!\n\nJust type what you want to create.",
    "completed_condition": "",
    "gameover_condition": "Immediately after each failed Loom Console calibration increments fracture_collapse, check whether tw.vars.get('fracture_collapse', 0) >= 3. If true, the Fracture overwhelms the Loom and the Construct collapses: end the adventure in defeat immediately. Do not allow further calibration attempts or other actions after this terminal outcome.",
    "completed_guard_expression": "tw.vars.get('loom_stabilized') == True",
    "gameover_guard_expression": "tw.vars.get('fracture_collapse', 0) >= 3",
