      "notes": "Knows the final digit of the harmonic calibration code and attunes the Catalyst when spoken to or interacted with.",
      "goal": "Guide the Catalyst to harmonize the Loom Console and anchor a stable reality before the Fracture widens.",
      "character": "Solemn, analytical, deeply reverent of human imagination, speaking in measured, poetic cadence.",
      "hp": 100,
      "max_hp": 100,
      "mana": 500,
