      "stat_modifier_armor_class": 0,
      "inventory": [],
      "hp_change": 0,
      "stamina_change": 0,
      "mana_change": 0,
      "text_log_content": "ARCHIVE ENTRY 00-FRACTURE:\nWhen the realities bled together, we sealed the Loom Console with a three-digit Harmonic Ratio derived from the sanctum's eternal architecture.\n\nFirst Digit: Count the colossal brass astrolabe rings revolving around the Loom.\nSecond Digit: Count the fractured marble pillars standing at the platform's edge.\nThird Digit: Ask The Architect for the Prime Catalyst Number\u2014the sole integer of unified meaning.",
      "text_log_format": "DOCUMENT",
      "on_pickup_script": "tw.vars.set('has_log', True)",
      "on_pickup_text": "The crystal tablet hums against your fingers, projecting faint lines of verse into your mind.",
      "on_drop_text": "The tablet settles back onto the obsidian surface with a chime.",
      "on_read_script": "tw.vars.set('read_fracture_log', True)\ntw.story.show_message('The Harmonic Ratio pattern imprints itself upon your memory.')",
      "on_read_text": "Light spills from the glyphs as you read the record of the Fracture."
    },
